   "rot": 0,
   "params": {
    "text": "**Try the hologram controls**\n1. DMD foci: 3 → 1 collapses the focal group.\n2. DMD scan: 0° → +1° shifts the sample hits.\n3. Fourier slit: 24 → 4 mm clips outer orders.\n4. Laser off or 0 W stops writing;\n589 nm observation remains independent.\n\nPositive source power changes metadata.\nThe voxel preview is not calibrated dose.\nZoom into the resin to inspect separate foci.",
